# OWASP Juice Shop Assessment Report

## Environment
- macOS
- Docker Container
- Burp Suite Community Edition

## Setup
Installed Docker and deployed OWASP Juice Shop locally on port 3000.

Configured Burp Suite proxy listener on:
127.0.0.1:8080

Configured browser proxy settings to route traffic through Burp Suite.

## Testing Activities
1. Intercepted HTTP requests
2. Reviewed request headers
3. Observed browser-server communication
4. Replayed requests using Repeater
5. Explored Juice Shop application behavior

## Sample Request Observed
GET / HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:3000

## Outcome
Successfully configured a local web application security testing environment and performed basic HTTP traffic analysis.